✓ State schemas with invariants
✓ Pre/post-conditions for operations
✓ Set theory and first-order logic
✓ Type system with dependent types
✓ Provable properties and theorems
✓ Object-oriented extensions to Z
✓ Precise semantics for all operations
*)
